id: 22
hanzi: 交际
pinyin: jiāo jì
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun / Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: social communication; social interaction; interpersonal contact; to socialize
  es: comunicación social; relaciones interpersonales; trato social; alternar

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | interpersonal communication, social activities, and public networking | comunicación interpersonal, relaciones públicas y vida social | 交际能力 (social / interpersonal skills)
  2 | Verb | Formal | to socialize with others, network, and engage in mutual relations | relacionarse con otros, alternar socialmente y cultivar contactos | 善于交际 (good at socializing)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 他在职场中不仅业务精湛，而且极富交际能力，总能妥善处理各部门之间错综复杂的协作关系。 | Tā zài zhíchǎng zhōng bùjǐn yèwù jīngzhàn, érqiě jí fù jiāojì nénglì, zǒng néng tuǒshàn chǔlǐ gè bùmén zhījiān cuòzōng-fùzá de xiézuò guānxi. | In the workplace, he is not only technically skilled but gifted in interpersonal skills, handling complex cross-department collaboration smoothly. | En el trabajo sobresale por su competencia técnica y sus dotes sociales, resolviendo con soltura la colaboración interdepartamental.
  #2 | 鲁迅并非不食人间烟火的孤傲斗士，在民国文人圈子里，他宴请同行、以文会友的交际活动十分频繁。 | Lǔ Xùn bìngfēi bùshí-rénjiān-yānhuǒ de gū'ào dòushì, zài Mínguó wénrén quānzi lǐ, tā yànqǐng tóngháng, yǐwén-huìyǒu de jiāojì huódòng shífēn pínfán. | Lu Xun was by no means an aloof hermit; in Republican literary circles, his social gatherings hosting peers and making friends were frequent. | Lu Xun no fue un ermitaño inaccesible; en los círculos letrados de la República alternaba con frecuencia agasajando colegas y trabando amistad.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  交际能力 | interpersonal/social skills
  善于交际 | good at socializing
  社交/交际圈 | social circle
  交际广泛 | broad social connections
  语言交际 | linguistic communication
  日常交际 | daily social interaction

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  八面玲珑 | bā miàn líng lóng | smooth and tactful in all directions; socially adept
  左右逢源 | zuǒ yòu féng yuán | gain resources left and right; navigate smoothly
  莫逆之交 | mò nì zhī jiāo | intimate, sworn friendship of complete mutual trust
  情投意合 | qíng tóu yì hé | find each other congenial; shared affinity

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  交 | jiāo | cross; intersect; deliver; associate; friend | cruzar; cruzarse; entregar; relacionarse; amigo | 亠 | lid | 亠 (head/torso) + 父 (crossed legs) | 交 (jiāo) | 6 | 单一结构 | Oracle bone pictogram of a standing human figure with crossed legs, symbolizing mutual exchange, crossing, and friendship. | A friendly figure extends open arms and crosses legs, ready to exchange ideas and make friends (交). | Una persona con las piernas cruzadas extiende los brazos, dispuesta a entablar trato y amistad (交). | 55 | YCK | ""
  际 | jì | border; boundary; between; juncture | borde; frontera; entre; coyuntura | 阝 | mound/hill | 阝 (mound/earthen wall) | 示 (shì, altar / connection between heaven and earth) | 7 | 左右结构 | Traditional 際 shows an altar 示 at the boundary border 阝 where human earth and divine heaven meet. | Standing at the boundary wall (阝) to present tokens (示) opens doors across border junctures (际). | Junto al muro fronterizo (阝), presentar ofrendas (示) permite tender puentes en el límite (际). | 51 | NLMF | 際

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Cross paths (交) across social boundaries (际) to engage in vibrant social communication (交际).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Cruza tus pasos (交) en el punto de encuentro fronterizo (际) para cultivar el trato social (交际).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Derived from classical Chinese semantics where 'jiāo' represents interpersonal bridge-building and 'jì' represents the interstice or nexus between diverse social actors.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Level high tone followed by falling tone: 'jiāo jì' (55-51). Articulate 'jiāo' on steady pitch 55, then drop cleanly into 4th tone 'jì'.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    父 | fù | father | Lacks the upper dot and crossbar 亠 of 交
    校 | xiào | school | Has tree radical 木 on left of 交
    郊 | jiāo | suburb | Has right city radical 阝 on the right of 交
    防 | fáng | defend | Has 方 on right instead of 示 in 际
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
    往 | wǎng | go to and fro; associate
    通 | tōng | connect; communicate smoothly
    往来 | wǎnglái | social dealings and visits
    涉 | shè | wade through river; involve

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 交际 emphasizes interpersonal networking, social protocol, and communicative competence in public life.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 交际 vs. 交流 | jiāoliú | 交流 emphasizes mutual two-way transmission of ideas, culture, or feelings, while 交际 emphasizes broad social networking and interpersonal diplomacy.
    2 | 交际 vs. 社交 | shèjiāo | 社交 is primarily a noun modifier describing social media or society events ('社交平台'), while 交际 focuses on conversational and diplomatic skill.
    3 | 交际 vs. 勾结 | gōujié | 勾结 has a strongly derogatory meaning of corrupt collusion, while 交际 is neutral and positive.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 健康的社交不在于微信列表里有成百上千个好友，而在于交际过程中彼此给予的真诚与温度。真正的交情不需要虚情假意的周旋应酬，而是三两知己围炉夜话时的推心置腹。懂得拒绝无效社交，心灵才能回归丰盈与清宁。 | Jiànkāng de shèjiāo bú zàiyú Wēixìn lièbiǎo lǐ yǒu chéngbǎi-shàngqiān ge hǎoyǒu, ér zàiyú jiāojì guòchéng zhōng bǐcǐ jǐyǔ de zhēnchéng yǔ wēndù. Zhēnzhèng de jiāoqíng bù xūyào xūqíng-jiǎyì de zhōuxuán yīngchou, ér shì sānliǎng zhījǐ wéilú-yèhuà shí de tuīxīn-zhìfù. Dǒngdé jùjué wúxiào shèjiāo, xīnlíng cáinéng huíguī fēngyíng yǔ qīngníng. | Healthy networking lies not in thousands of virtual contacts, but sincerity exchanged. True friendship requires no hypocritical pleasantries, but candid fireside chats with true confidants. Rejecting shallow social noise restores peace. | La sana sociabilidad no se mide en listas interminables de contactos, sino en la sinceridad mutua. La amistad verdadera prescinde de cumplidos vanos y prefiere la sobremesa franca al calor del hogar. Filtrar el ruido social devuelve la paz interior.
  #2 | 跨文化交际能力已成为全球化时代国际复合型人才的必备素养。面对不同国家和民族在价值观与行为范式上的客观差异，青年一代必须学会以开放包容的胸怀倾听对话，在跨文化交际中化解误解偏见，增进不同文明间的互信互鉴。 | Kuà wénhuà jiāojì nénglì yǐ chéngwéi quánqiúhuà shídài guójì fùhéxíng réncái de bìbèi sùyǎng. Miànduì bùtóng guójiā yǔ mínzú zài jiàzhíguān yǔ xíngwéi fànshì shàng de kèguān chāyì, qīngnián yídài bìxū xuéhuì yǐ kāifàng bāoróng de xiōnghuái qīngtīng duìhuà, zài kuà wénhuà jiāojì zhōng huàjiě wùjiě piānjiàn, zēngjìn bùtóng wénmíng jiān de hùxìn hùjiàn. | Cross-cultural communication competence has become essential for global talent. Facing differences in values and norms, youth must listen with an inclusive mindset, dispelling misunderstandings through dialogue to foster mutual civilizational trust. | La competencia intercultural es indispensable para el talento globalizado. Ante las divergencias de valores y costumbres, las nuevas generaciones deben dialogar con mente abierta, desvaneciendo prejuicios y cimentando la confianza mutua entre pueblos.
